      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Re-read the sources of truth. Decide if anything changed enough to act.\nThe goal is not an agent that never stops, but one that stops, sleeps, and wakes up with context.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 18
